  "_notes": [
    "Canon drop pattern: B1 Feet + basic weapon, B2 Legs + healer off-hand,",
    "B3 Head, B4 Chest + strong weapon, B5 class capstone + Raid Trinket.",
    "NAME COLLISIONS ARE CANON and intentional here, as at the starting rung:",
    "three different 'Basic Raid Staff' (10/11/12 Damage), three different",
    "'Strong Raid Staff' (14/15/16), three different 'Raider's Leggings'",
    "(monk_rogue 5AC / healer 3AC / mage_wizard 3AC) and two identical",
    "'Raider's Boots' in different families. Ids are identity, names are not.",
    "The Rogue's Basic Raid Dagger is +4 against a +5 Adventure sword, a",
    "deliberate-looking DROP in weapon damage at the first raid rung.",
    "docs/09 OQ-11/OQ-15 flag it; transcribed as canon has it, not smoothed.",
    "Boss 5 drops ONE trinket per clear drawn from boss5_trinket_pool (four",
    "charms), so fully trinketing 12 raiders takes roughly 12 clears.",
    "Drop COUNTS per encounter belong to docs/10, not this file."
  ],
